#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:2 3061652d74674dd189311855d82dc019
msgid "DSP 效果器"
msgstr "DSP Effects"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:4 9c356505bd3546879f1d4869904474c8
msgid "本章讲“怎样给声音加效果”。"
msgstr "This chapter explains how to add effects to sounds."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:6 982735a0ae1a4254a428f02551a0ccb6
msgid ""
":ref:`DSP<glossary-dsp>` 是音频效果处理单元。混响、滤波、延迟、压缩、频谱分析都可以看成 DSP。刚开始使用时，建议优先用 ``FmodAudioEffect*`` "
"这些资源类，把效果加到 :ref:`Bus<glossary-bus>` 上；只有需要非常底层的控制时，再直接操作 :ref:`FmodDSP<class_FmodDSP>`。"
msgstr ""
"A :ref:`DSP<glossary-dsp>` is an audio effect processing unit. Reverb, filtering, delay, "
"compression, and spectrum analysis can all be treated as DSPs. When getting started, prefer the "
"``FmodAudioEffect*`` resource classes and add effects to a :ref:`Bus<glossary-bus>`. Use "
":ref:`FmodDSP<class_FmodDSP>` directly only when you need very low-level control."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:9 4de4d59ac9c64c1689f54f8cadf78fbb
