#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:66 bc6a7e756dd14763a9bbcedccc0b401e
msgid "以下布局编辑示例使用独立模式：关闭 ``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses`` 并重新加载项目，先在 FMOD Audio 面板创建示例需要的总线。"
msgstr ""
"The following layout-editing examples use independent mode: disable "
"``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses``, reload the project, and create the required buses in FMOD "
"Audio first."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:68 7c81c2a1c1f6429a93dea0b04bcfa4a2
msgid ""
"槽位保存效果配置，每个槽位都有独立运行实例。用 "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` 读取 "
"Capture、SpectrumAnalyzer 和 Record 的实时数据。添加槽位后调用 ``flush_bus_updates()``，即可在同一帧取得实例。"
msgstr ""
"Slots store effect configuration and each owns an independent runtime instance. Use "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` to "
"read live Capture, SpectrumAnalyzer, and Record data. After adding a slot, call "
"``flush_bus_updates()`` to obtain its instance in the same frame."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:70 35886d8a11fa4c878350925419e60d6a
msgid "下面示例给 ``Music`` 总线加一个低通滤波器。它会让音乐听起来更闷，适合暂停菜单、角色潜水、隔墙听声等场景。"
msgstr ""
"The following example adds a low-pass filter to the ``Music`` bus. It makes the music sound "
"muffled, which is useful for pause menus, underwater scenes, or hearing sound through walls."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:72 92f8ba7286d34c5ea61a078eb08a474f
msgid ""
"func add_pause_filter() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"\n"
"    var filter: FmodAudioEffectFilter = FmodAudioEffectFilter.new()\n"
"    filter.cutoff_hz = 1200.0\n"
"    filter.resonance = 0.2\n"
"\n"
"    layout.add_bus_effect(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\"), filter)"
msgstr ""
"func add_pause_filter() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"\n"
"    var filter: FmodAudioEffectFilter = FmodAudioEffectFilter.new()\n"
"    filter.cutoff_hz = 1200.0\n"
"    filter.resonance = 0.2\n"
"\n"
"    layout.add_bus_effect(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\"), filter)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:84 c99cb47996b9494c8b84f4a28931131a
msgid "效果加到总线后，经过这条 :ref:`Bus<glossary-bus>` 的声音都会受影响。"
msgstr ""
"After an effect is added to a bus, all sounds passing through that :ref:`Bus<glossary-bus>` are "
"affected."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:87 4f22aa935b984493aaa3a1dc68087ee3
msgid "旁路效果"
msgstr "Bypass Effects"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:89 97280a9aad7d450f9139e192771f1208
msgid "如果只是临时关闭效果，优先用旁路，而不是反复创建和删除。"
msgstr ""
"If you only need to temporarily disable an effect, prefer bypassing it instead of repeatedly "
"creating and deleting it."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:91 63a1423d09b8447ebec739cc507b00da
msgid ""
"func set_music_effects_enabled(enabled: bool) -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    layout.set_bus_bypass(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\"), not enabled)"
msgstr ""
"func set_music_effects_enabled(enabled: bool) -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    layout.set_bus_bypass(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\"), not enabled)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:98 f132542e857c4205a6595ad59ef7ee15
msgid "旁路的意思是：信号仍然通过，但跳过这条总线上的效果处理。"
msgstr "Bypass means the signal still passes through, but the effects on that bus are skipped."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:101 da11530c8a9248ea8304a475bf6b336d
msgid "常用效果示例"
msgstr "Common Effect Examples"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:104 0ab02331f20f41c9b40a333389fd217f
msgid "暂停菜单：音乐变闷"
msgstr "Pause menu: muffle the music"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:106 28f2684bc5db4ce1befdf534f571a1d3
msgid ""
"var pause_filter: FmodAudioEffectFilter = FmodAudioEffectFilter.new()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    pause_filter.cutoff_hz = 1000.0\n"
"    pause_filter.resonance = 0.1\n"
"    layout.add_bus_effect(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\"), pause_filter)\n"
"    layout.set_bus_bypass(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\"), true)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func set_paused_audio(paused: bool) -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    layout.set_bus_bypass(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\"), not paused)"
msgstr ""
"var pause_filter: FmodAudioEffectFilter = FmodAudioEffectFilter.new()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    pause_filter.cutoff_hz = 1000.0\n"
"    pause_filter.resonance = 0.1\n"
"    layout.add_bus_effect(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\"), pause_filter)\n"
"    layout.set_bus_bypass(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\"), true)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func set_paused_audio(paused: bool) -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    layout.set_bus_bypass(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\"), not paused)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:124 19109f2c5890467aa4af3eb3ae33cea7
msgid "房间混响：给环境声加空间感"
msgstr "Room reverb: add space to ambience"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:126 0317ba02a4b440d29c51a5e50d1f1e3a
msgid ""
"func setup_room_reverb() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var reverb: FmodAudioEffectReverb = FmodAudioEffectReverb.new()\n"
"    reverb.room_size = 0.7\n"
"    reverb.damping = 0.45\n"
"    reverb.wet = 0.35\n"
"    reverb.dry = 1.0\n"
"\n"
"    layout.add_bus_effect(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Ambient\"), reverb)"
msgstr ""
"func setup_room_reverb() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var reverb: FmodAudioEffectReverb = FmodAudioEffectReverb.new()\n"
"    reverb.room_size = 0.7\n"
"    reverb.damping = 0.45\n"
"    reverb.wet = 0.35\n"
"    reverb.dry = 1.0\n"
"\n"
"    layout.add_bus_effect(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Ambient\"), reverb)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:140 7bfba8cefcf44a3c8ff418c9b499b710
msgid "均衡器：削弱刺耳频段"
msgstr "Equalizer: reduce harsh frequencies"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:142 92f8ba7286d34c5ea61a078eb08a474f
msgid ""
"func soften_sfx() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var eq: FmodAudioEffectEQ10 = FmodAudioEffectEQ10.new()\n"
"\n"
"    # 降低较高频段，让音效不那么刺耳\n"
"    eq.set_band_gain_db(7, -3.0)\n"
"    eq.set_band_gain_db(8, -4.0)\n"
"\n"
"    layout.add_bus_effect(layout.find_bus_id(&\"SFX\"), eq)"
msgstr ""
"func soften_sfx() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var eq: FmodAudioEffectEQ10 = FmodAudioEffectEQ10.new()\n"
"\n"
"    # Reduce higher bands to soften sharp sound effects\n"
"    eq.set_band_gain_db(7, -3.0)\n"
"    eq.set_band_gain_db(8, -4.0)\n"
"\n"
"    layout.add_bus_effect(layout.find_bus_id(&\"SFX\"), eq)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:156 70aacb1924f74d2db0c8dbef5fb860e8
msgid "延迟：给特殊音效加回声"
msgstr "Delay: add echo to a special voice effect"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:158 1e7d6b22734443f292e3e824c0220baa
msgid ""
"func add_echo_to_voice_bus() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var delay: FmodAudioEffectDelay = FmodAudioEffectDelay.new()\n"
"    delay.tap1_delay_ms = 180.0\n"
"    delay.tap1_level_db = -8.0\n"
"    delay.tap2_active = false\n"
"    delay.feedback_active = true\n"
"    delay.feedback_delay_ms = 260.0\n"
"    delay.feedback_level_db = -12.0\n"
"\n"
"    layout.add_bus_effect(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Voice\"), delay)"
msgstr ""
"func add_echo_to_voice_bus() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var delay: FmodAudioEffectDelay = FmodAudioEffectDelay.new()\n"
"    delay.tap1_delay_ms = 180.0\n"
"    delay.tap1_level_db = -8.0\n"
"    delay.tap2_active = false\n"
"    delay.feedback_active = true\n"
"    delay.feedback_delay_ms = 260.0\n"
"    delay.feedback_level_db = -12.0\n"
"\n"
"    layout.add_bus_effect(layout.find_bus_id(&\"Voice\"), delay)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:174 52356a724b314af3a1dfa1833069025d
msgid "频谱分析：读取音乐能量"
msgstr "Spectrum analysis: read music energy"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:176 52145f2f23c0496baf911c9926698ee1
msgid "``FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer`` 不改变声音，它只是读取频谱数据。适合音乐可视化、根据低频驱动画面等。"
msgstr ""
"``FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer`` does not change the sound. It only reads spectrum data, which"
" is useful for music visualization or driving visuals from bass energy."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:178 1b33cc771442493580e3371b94413107
msgid ""
"var analyzer: FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var music_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\")\n"
"    var settings: FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer = FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.new()\n"
"    settings.fft_size = FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.FFT_SIZE_2048\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(music_id, settings)\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    analyzer = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(music_id, slot_id) as "
"FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if analyzer == null:\n"
"        return\n"
"    var bass: Vector2 = analyzer.get_magnitude_for_frequency_range(\n"
"        20.0,\n"
"        250.0,\n"
"        FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.MAGNITUDE_AVERAGE,\n"
"    )\n"
"    print(\"bass energy: \", bass.length())"
msgstr ""
"var analyzer: FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var music_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\")\n"
"    var settings: FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer = FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.new()\n"
"    settings.fft_size = FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.FFT_SIZE_2048\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(music_id, settings)\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    analyzer = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(music_id, slot_id) as "
"FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if analyzer == null:\n"
"        return\n"
"    var bass: Vector2 = analyzer.get_magnitude_for_frequency_range(\n"
"        20.0,\n"
"        250.0,\n"
"        FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer.MAGNITUDE_AVERAGE,\n"
"    )\n"
"    print(\"bass energy: \", bass.length())"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:204 0d8174e20df142b899043deae9c40edc
msgid "录音：录下某条总线"
msgstr "Recording: record a bus"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:206 e9a101cc60494641983e54a22452525e
msgid "``FmodAudioEffectRecord`` 会让声音原样通过，同时在录制开启时缓存经过总线的音频。"
msgstr ""
"``FmodAudioEffectRecord`` lets the sound pass through unchanged while caching the audio that "
"passes through the bus when recording is enabled."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:208 d6fcd589bc0b45f686f414cdc487e82a
msgid ""
"var recorder: FmodAudioEffectRecord\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var settings: FmodAudioEffectRecord = FmodAudioEffectRecord.new()\n"
"    settings.format = FmodAudioEffectRecord.FORMAT_16_BITS\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(0, settings)\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    recorder = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(0, slot_id) as FmodAudioEffectRecord\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func start_recording() -> void:\n"
"    if recorder != null:\n"
"        recorder.recording_active = true\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func stop_recording() -> AudioStreamWAV:\n"
"    if recorder == null:\n"
"        return null\n"
"    recorder.recording_active = false\n"
"    return recorder.get_recording()"
msgstr ""
"var recorder: FmodAudioEffectRecord\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var settings: FmodAudioEffectRecord = FmodAudioEffectRecord.new()\n"
"    settings.format = FmodAudioEffectRecord.FORMAT_16_BITS\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(0, settings)\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    recorder = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(0, slot_id) as FmodAudioEffectRecord\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func start_recording() -> void:\n"
"    if recorder != null:\n"
"        recorder.recording_active = true\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func stop_recording() -> AudioStreamWAV:\n"
"    if recorder == null:\n"
"        return null\n"
"    recorder.recording_active = false\n"
"    return recorder.get_recording()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:234 bea1d99f6f2448dd8a3349d025e32520
msgid "效果顺序"
msgstr "Effect Order"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:236 9c19411fb5c1425494262e0a4149e302
msgid "多个 :ref:`DSP<glossary-dsp>` 会组成 :ref:`DSP 链<glossary-dsp-chain>`。声音会按顺序经过它们，所以顺序会影响听感。"
msgstr ""
"Multiple :ref:`DSP<glossary-dsp>` units form a :ref:`DSP Chain<glossary-dsp-chain>`. Sound passes"
" through them in order, so the order affects how it sounds."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:238 086fd974ab194edd91f77d522620745d
msgid "一个容易理解的默认顺序是："
msgstr "An easy default order to understand is:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:240 82902509dc344ddca6d4a46e50fbcb2e
msgid "Equalizer / filter -> compressor -> distortion -> delay / reverb -> analyzer / recorder"
msgstr "Equalizer / filter -> compressor -> distortion -> delay / reverb -> analyzer / recorder"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:244 3d603dfed8ae4849b812f2419d21d794
msgid "这不是硬规则。比如先失真再混响，和先混响再失真，听起来会很不一样。调效果时建议一次只改一个变量，边听边调。"
msgstr ""
"This is not a hard rule. Distortion before reverb and reverb before distortion can sound very "
"different. When tuning effects, change one variable at a time and listen as you adjust."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:247 be983bdd4fe34f75b9df172e9db1ed91
msgid "什么时候直接用 FmodDSP"
msgstr "When to Use FmodDSP Directly"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:249 14aae6b7c48f4881ae0d3c32f141cf53
msgid "``FmodAudioEffect*`` 更适合用户指南里的常规用法；``FmodDSP`` 更接近底层 FMOD。"
msgstr ""
"``FmodAudioEffect*`` is better for the common workflows in this guide; ``FmodDSP`` is closer to "
"low-level FMOD."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:251 bd8267fccda94a54b09bf503fc795d3b
msgid "只有在这些情况才建议直接用 :ref:`FmodDSP<class_FmodDSP>`："
msgstr "Use :ref:`FmodDSP<class_FmodDSP>` directly only when:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:253 1ef9d6aa699943639d51cd8e37a590a5
msgid "需要访问 FMOD 内置 DSP 的原始参数索引。"
msgstr "You need access to raw parameter indices of FMOD built-in DSPs."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:254 20ec0094909a430bae40edaeca699b56
msgid "需要手动插入某个 :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>` 的 DSP 链。"
msgstr "You need to manually insert a DSP into a specific :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>` DSP chain."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:255 29bd2cffdc3b4212a6881742ad68523f
msgid "需要自定义 DSP 回调或做实验性处理。"
msgstr "You need custom DSP callbacks or experimental processing."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:256 eaefa2e210b7400bb0074641f3d47925
msgid "你已经知道对应 DSP 的参数含义和范围。"
msgstr "You already know the meaning and range of the corresponding DSP parameters."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:258 5c36e9f840cb410ab7c2fd5f7b1db983
msgid "一个最小示例："
msgstr "A minimal example:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:260 371e0d33ce1448999a695dea91e31121
msgid ""
"func add_low_level_reverb() -> void:\n"
"    var system: FmodSystem = FmodServer.get_main_system()\n"
"    var reverb: FmodDSP = system.create_dsp_by_type(FmodDSP.DSP_TYPE_SFXREVERB)\n"
"    var master: FmodChannelGroup = system.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"\n"
"    master.add_dsp(0, reverb)"
msgstr ""
"func add_low_level_reverb() -> void:\n"
"    var system: FmodSystem = FmodServer.get_main_system()\n"
"    var reverb: FmodDSP = system.create_dsp_by_type(FmodDSP.DSP_TYPE_SFXREVERB)\n"
"    var master: FmodChannelGroup = system.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"\n"
"    master.add_dsp(0, reverb)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:270 57eb1f95f1b44f8e84536c839004b67b
msgid "低层 DSP 参数通常是数字索引，不如 ``FmodAudioEffectReverb.room_size`` 这类属性直观。普通项目优先使用效果资源类。"
msgstr ""
"Low-level DSP parameters are usually numeric indices and are less intuitive than properties such "
"as ``FmodAudioEffectReverb.room_size``. For regular projects, prefer effect resource classes."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:273 5c777999cf2947d89d7717e3569a44bd
msgid "性能建议"
msgstr "Performance Tips"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:275 717035414b8748acb0aea86482480d26
msgid "每个启用的 :ref:`DSP<glossary-dsp>` 都会增加 CPU 开销。"
msgstr "Each enabled :ref:`DSP<glossary-dsp>` adds CPU cost."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:276 f4efa20003d94c1892aa80016a9d636c
msgid "多个声音共享同一种效果时，放到总线上通常更省。"
msgstr "When multiple sounds share the same effect, putting it on a bus is usually cheaper."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:277 d94f8b2b7c484f0f928f9182e1ed1b78
msgid "临时关闭效果时，用旁路比反复添加、移除更稳定。"
msgstr ""
"When temporarily disabling an effect, bypassing is more stable than repeatedly adding and "
"removing it."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:278 0a04e13ff6b5434e849e7395e44e6ac5
msgid "频谱分析和音高变换这类 FFT 效果更容易吃 CPU。"
msgstr "FFT effects such as spectrum analysis and pitch shifting are more CPU-hungry."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:279 8035c2f11e8d4bd1a792dff35e4c7a09
msgid "不要每帧大幅跳变参数；需要变化时用插值或 Tween。"
msgstr ""
"Do not make large parameter jumps every frame; use interpolation or Tween when values need to "
"change."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:282 2612bbe3b9f141d49332986123acbe77
msgid "排查清单"
msgstr "Troubleshooting Checklist"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:284 12c084ee80794df888e78b6e02b49f62
msgid "效果没有声音变化时，先检查："
msgstr "If an effect does not change the sound, check:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:286 7a0c8ccb9d0e4932b01cced046073805
msgid "声音是否真的输出到这条 :ref:`Bus<glossary-bus>`。"
msgstr "Whether the sound is really routed to this :ref:`Bus<glossary-bus>`."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:287 e528d455ac4e4c01a09cf16695f320ca
msgid "总线是否被旁路。"
msgstr "Whether the bus is bypassed."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:288 919031dbd59a4784866496df0403d578
msgid "效果参数是否太轻，听不出来。"
msgstr "Whether the effect parameters are too subtle to hear."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:289 4445021d948c40b489d16eba9a7b2cd2
msgid "效果是否加到了错误的总线。"
msgstr "Whether the effect was added to the wrong bus."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dsp_effects.rst:290 edcea17e62284d4f968a50863fb19f10
msgid "多个效果顺序是否和预期一致。"
msgstr "Whether the order of multiple effects matches your expectation."
